      "title": "z-Tree: Zurich toolbox for ready-made economic experiments",
      "abstract": "<jats:title>Abstract</jats:title><jats:p>z-Tree (Zurich Toolbox for Ready-made Economic Experiments) is a software for developing and conducting economic experiments. The software is stable and allows programming almost any kind of experiments in a short time. In this article, I present the guiding principles behind the software design, its features, and its limitations.</jats:p>",
